1
00:00:00,811 --> 00:00:01,851
Good night, Sheldon.

2
00:00:02,021 --> 00:00:04,771
- But how am I going to get to work?
- Take the bus.

3
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:07,360
But I can't take the bus.
They don't have seat belts.

4
00:00:07,526 --> 00:00:10,866
(Sheldon:)And they won't let you lash yourself
to the seat with bungee cords.

5
00:00:11,322 --> 00:00:14,162
(Leonard:)You tried to lash yourself
to the seat with bungee cords?

6
00:00:14,325 --> 00:00:16,915
(Sheldon:)I didn't try, I succeeded.

7
00:00:17,661 --> 00:00:21,711
But for some reason, it alarmed the other
passengers and I was asked to de-bus.

8
00:00:21,874 --> 00:00:24,544
(Leonard:)Oh, you're a big boy. You'll figure it out.

9
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:26,540
(Sheldon:)Don't talk to me like I'm a child.

10
00:00:26,712 --> 00:00:30,002
(Sheldon:)Now take me
to return my Star Wars sheets.

11
00:00:31,884 --> 00:00:33,014
(Sheldon:)Penny?

12
00:00:33,177 --> 00:00:35,007
Penny? Penny?

13
00:00:35,846 --> 00:00:38,386
(Penny(opening door):)Sheldon, what is it?

14
00:00:38,557 --> 00:00:40,647
(Sheldon:)Leonard's asleep.

15
00:00:42,603 --> 00:00:43,933
(Penny:)Thanks for the update.

16
00:00:44,105 --> 00:00:46,025
(Sheldon:)No, wait.

17
00:00:46,232 --> 00:00:47,812
(Sheldon:)You have to drive me to work.

18
00:00:48,359 --> 00:00:51,029
Yeah, I really don't think I do.

19
00:00:51,529 --> 00:00:53,989
(Sheldon:)But I don't drive
and I can't take the bus.

20
00:00:54,156 --> 00:00:56,866
(Penny:)You'll be fine as long as
you don't do that bungee thing.

21
00:00:57,034 --> 00:00:58,324
(Scene:)Penny.

22
00:00:59,537 --> 00:01:02,417
(Sheldon:)Didn't you recently state
that you and I are friends?

23
00:01:03,666 --> 00:01:06,546
(Penny:)Yes, Sheldon, we are friends.

24
00:01:06,710 --> 00:01:09,340
(Sheldon:)Then I hereby invoke
what I'm given to understand...

25
00:01:09,505 --> 00:01:12,885
(Sheldon:)...is an integral part
of the implied covenant of friendship.

26
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:18,560
The favor.

27
00:01:19,723 --> 00:01:21,263
(Penny:)Oh, dear God.

28
00:01:22,059 --> 00:01:25,689
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, I didn't realize
I was interrupting your morning prayers.

29
00:01:27,022 --> 00:01:31,032
(Sheldon:)When you're done, we'll go.

